          "normalized_title": "Researchers Discover a Mysterious New Frog Species in the Amazon",
          "normalized_summary": "A small frog living in a flooded corner of the Amazon has turned out to be something scientists had never formally recognized before. Some species hide in remote places. Others hide in plain sight. In the western Brazilian Amazon, scientists have identified a new frog species, Adenomera varcena, living in forests that are seasonally submerged [...]",
