          "normalized_title": "Scientists Find Just 3 Minutes of Sprinting Can Transform Blood Chemistry",
          "normalized_summary": "A few minutes of sprinting triggered a much larger immediate molecular response than prolonged moderate exercise and altered proteins linked to better metabolic health. Just three minutes of intense sprinting can produce molecular changes in the bloodstream that look very different from those seen after much longer periods of moderate exercise. Researchers at Rockefeller compared [...]",
